flowchart LR
    Source[Unchanged source CSV] --> Loader[Validate and integrate hourly Wh]
    Loader --> Manifest[Independent expected-key manifest]
    Loader --> Journal[(SQLite readings and submission journal)]
    Journal --> Registry[Role-controlled append-once registry]
    Manifest --> Auditor[Read-only fixed-block audit]
    Journal --> Auditor
    Registry --> Auditor
    Auditor --> Outcomes[VERIFIED / TAMPERED / MISSING_RECORD / MISSING_COMMITMENT / MISSING_BOTH / ERROR]
    Outcomes --> Evidence[CSV evidence and evaluation]
